{"title": "Stillness of Mind", "pageid": 40467, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Stillness_of_Mind", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the action triggered by the passive feature. For the corresponding passive, see <a href=\"/wiki/Stillness_of_Mind_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Stillness of Mind (passive feature)\">Stillness of Mind (passive feature)</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Stillness_of_Mind.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Stillness_of_Mind.webp/300px-Stillness_of_Mind.webp, /w/images/7/7d/Stillness_of_Mind.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Stillness_of_Mind.webp/300px-Stillness_of_Mind.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Stillness_of_Mind.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Stillness of Mind</b> is a class action used by <a href=\"/wiki/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">Monks</a> which purges any <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(status_group)\" title=\"Charmed (status group)\">Charmed</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(status_group)\" title=\"Frightened (status group)\">Frightened</a> condition affecting the monk. It is automatically cast by the corresponding passive, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stillness_of_Mind_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Stillness of Mind (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp/20px-Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp/30px-Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp/40px-Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stillness of Mind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp/20px-Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stillness_of_Mind_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Stillness of Mind (passive feature)\">Stillness of Mind</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nRemove <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(status_group)\" title=\"Charmed (status group)\">Charmed</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(status_group)\" title=\"Frightened (status group)\">Frightened</a> conditions.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_StillnessOfMind</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_StillnessOfMind\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_StillnessOfMind\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 7: <a href=\"/wiki/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">Monk</a></li></ul>\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stillness_of_Mind_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Stillness of Mind (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp/38px-Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp/50px-Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stillness of Mind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stillness_of_Mind_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Stillness of Mind (passive feature)\">Stillness of Mind</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This action is automatically cast by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stillness_of_Mind_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Stillness of Mind (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp/38px-Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp/50px-Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stillness of Mind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Stillness_of_Mind_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stillness_of_Mind_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Stillness of Mind (passive feature)\">Stillness of Mind</a> passive feature at the cost of an <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a>. There is no way to disable this in the <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction_(Combat)#Reactions_Tab\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction (Combat)\">reactions tab</a> or to toggle off the passive.\n<ul><li>This counter-intuitively makes some <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(status_group)\" title=\"Charmed (status group)\">Charmed</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(status_group)\" title=\"Frightened (status group)\">Frightened</a> effects more dangerous for monks. Instead of just suffering from their relatively minor effects, a monk with Stillness of Mind will lose a full <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> instead.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035317\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.070 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2433/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28868/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11317/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1332732/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   59.992      1 -total\n 98.71%   59.218      1 Template:Feature_page\n 81.52%   48.908     26 Template:Trim\n 25.75%   15.447      1 Template:SmPass\n 16.35%    9.806      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 12.06%    7.232      4 Template:Icon_text\n 11.67%    6.999      3 Template:Passive_inline/format\n 10.79%    6.471      3 Template:Icon_link\n 10.12%    6.074      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.73%    5.834      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:40467-0!canonical and timestamp 2